{"seq":3,"slug":"react-pattern","title":"ReAct 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns/react-pattern","wordCount":1638,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"react-模式\">ReAct 模式</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>让 LLM 直接生成最终答案（Direct Prompting）在简单任务中效果不错，但面对需要多步推理和外部信息获取的复杂任务时，模型容易产生幻觉或遗漏关键步骤。另一方面，纯粹的&quot;思维链&quot;（Chain of Thought）推理虽然改善了推理质量，但模型仍然只能依赖自身的知识，无法与外部世界交互来获取实时信息或验证推理结果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Direct Prompting&#10;        direction LR&#10;        Q1[&quot;Question&quot;] --&gt; A1[&quot;Direct Answer&lt;br/&gt;(May hallucinate)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;Chain-of-Thought (CoT)&quot;&#10;        direction LR&#10;        Q2[&quot;Question&quot;] --&gt; T[&quot;Reasoning Process&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;Answer&lt;br/&gt;(Internal knowledge only)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph ReAct&#10;        direction LR&#10;        Q3[&quot;Question&quot;] --&gt; TH[&quot;Think&quot;] --&gt; ACT[&quot;Act&quot;] --&gt; OBS[&quot;Observe&quot;]&#10;        OBS --&gt;|&quot;Continue&quot;| TH&#10;        OBS --&gt;|&quot;Done&quot;| A3[&quot;Answer&lt;br/&gt;(Externally verified)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Direct Prompting\n        direction LR\n        Q1[\"Question\"] --&gt; A1[\"Direct Answer&lt;br/&gt;(May hallucinate)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Chain-of-Thought (CoT)\"\n        direction LR\n        Q2[\"Question\"] --&gt; T[\"Reasoning Process\"] --&gt; A2[\"Answer&lt;br/&gt;(Internal knowledge only)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph ReAct\n        direction LR\n        Q3[\"Question\"] --&gt; TH[\"Think\"] --&gt; ACT[\"Act\"] --&gt; OBS[\"Observe\"]\n        OBS --&gt;|\"Continue\"| TH\n        OBS --&gt;|\"Done\"| A3[\"Answer&lt;br/&gt;(Externally verified)\"]\n    end</pre><p>我们需要一种将推理（Reasoning）和行动（Acting）结合起来的模式，让模型既能&quot;想清楚&quot;，又能&quot;做实验&quot;——这就是 ReAct。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ReAct（Reasoning + Acting）是一套让模型&quot;边想边做&quot;的循环范式：每一步先产出一段<strong>思考（Thought）<strong>分析当前状态并决定下一步，再选择一个</strong>行动（Action）<strong>去调用工具，然后读取工具返回的</strong>观察（Observation）<strong>作为新的输入，如此往复直到能给出最终答案。把它与直接提示（Direct Prompting）和纯思维链（CoT）区分开的关键，在于推理与外部行动是</strong>交替且互相校正</strong>的——Thought 让推理过程可见，Action 让模型能主动获取信息，Observation 则用真实结果锚定推理，从而抑制幻觉。代价是每一步都要付出一次模型调用与一次工具调用的延迟和 Token 成本。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"模式定义\">模式定义</h2><p>ReAct（Reasoning + Acting）是由 Yao et al. (2022) 提出的一种让语言模型交替进行推理和行动的框架。它的核心思想是：在每一步中，模型先进行思考（Thought），然后决定一个行动（Action），执行后得到观察结果（Observation），再基于观察继续思考——形成一个不断迭代的循环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[&quot;Receive Task&quot;] --&gt; THOUGHT&#10;&#10;    subgraph ReAct Loop&#10;        THOUGHT[&quot;💭 Thought&lt;br/&gt;Analyze state, plan next step&quot;]&#10;        ACTION[&quot;⚡ Action&lt;br/&gt;Select and execute a tool call&quot;]&#10;        OBSERVATION[&quot;👁 Observation&lt;br/&gt;Get action return result&quot;]&#10;&#10;        THOUGHT --&gt; ACTION&#10;        ACTION --&gt; OBSERVATION&#10;        OBSERVATION --&gt;|&quot;Task not done&quot;| THOUGHT&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    OBSERVATION --&gt;|&quot;Task complete&quot;| ANSWER[&quot;Output Final Answer&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    START[\"Receive Task\"] --&gt; THOUGHT\n\n    subgraph ReAct Loop\n        THOUGHT[\"💭 Thought&lt;br/&gt;Analyze state, plan next step\"]\n        ACTION[\"⚡ Action&lt;br/&gt;Select and execute a tool call\"]\n        OBSERVATION[\"👁 Observation&lt;br/&gt;Get action return result\"]\n\n        THOUGHT --&gt; ACTION\n        ACTION --&gt; OBSERVATION\n        OBSERVATION --&gt;|\"Task not done\"| THOUGHT\n    end\n\n    OBSERVATION --&gt;|\"Task complete\"| ANSWER[\"Output Final Answer\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成部分</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Thought（思考）</td>\n<td>分析当前状态，推理下一步应该做什么</td>\n<td>LLM 生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Action（行动）</td>\n<td>调用外部工具获取信息或执行操作</td>\n<td>LLM 选择，系统执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Observation（观察）</td>\n<td>行动返回的结果，作为下一轮推理的输入</td>\n<td>工具返回</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> ReAct 的关键创新在于让推理过程&quot;可见&quot;且&quot;可交互&quot;——Thought 让我们看到模型在想什么，Action 让模型能做什么，Observation 让模型知道发生了什么。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><h3 id=\"react-逐步执行示例\">ReAct 逐步执行示例</h3><p>以一个实际的 AI 编程场景为例——用户要求&quot;找到项目中所有未使用的导入并删除它们&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"用户: 找到项目中所有未使用的导入并删除它们&#10;&#10;Thought 1: 我需要先了解项目的语言和结构。让我搜索项目配置文件。&#10;Action 1: SearchFile(&quot;tsconfig.json&quot;)&#10;Observation 1: 找到 /project/tsconfig.json，这是一个 TypeScript 项目。&#10;&#10;Thought 2: 这是 TypeScript 项目。我可以使用 ESLint 的 no-unused-imports 规则来检测，&#10;           或者直接搜索源代码文件。让我先看看项目结构。&#10;Action 2: ListFiles(&quot;src/&quot;)&#10;Observation 2: 返回了 23 个 .ts/.tsx 文件的列表。&#10;&#10;Thought 3: 文件不多，让我用 grep 搜索 import 语句，然后逐个检查使用情况。&#10;           先从 src/utils/helpers.ts 开始。&#10;Action 3: ReadFile(&quot;src/utils/helpers.ts&quot;)&#10;Observation 3: 文件内容显示导入了 lodash 的 debounce 和 throttle，&#10;              但代码中只使用了 debounce。&#10;&#10;Thought 4: 发现 throttle 未被使用。我需要修改这个导入语句。&#10;Action 4: EditFile(&quot;src/utils/helpers.ts&quot;, 移除 throttle 导入)&#10;Observation 4: 文件已成功修改。&#10;&#10;Thought 5: helpers.ts 处理完毕。继续检查下一个文件...&#10;...（循环继续）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>用户: 找到项目中所有未使用的导入并删除它们</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Thought 1: 我需要先了解项目的语言和结构。让我搜索项目配置文件。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Action 1: SearchFile(\"tsconfig.json\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Observation 1: 找到 /project/tsconfig.json，这是一个 TypeScript 项目。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Thought 2: 这是 TypeScript 项目。我可以使用 ESLint 的 no-unused-imports 规则来检测，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           或者直接搜索源代码文件。让我先看看项目结构。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Action 2: ListFiles(\"src/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Observation 2: 返回了 23 个 .ts/.tsx 文件的列表。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Thought 3: 文件不多，让我用 grep 搜索 import 语句，然后逐个检查使用情况。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           先从 src/utils/helpers.ts 开始。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Action 3: ReadFile(\"src/utils/helpers.ts\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Observation 3: 文件内容显示导入了 lodash 的 debounce 和 throttle，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              但代码中只使用了 debounce。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Thought 4: 发现 throttle 未被使用。我需要修改这个导入语句。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Action 4: EditFile(\"src/utils/helpers.ts\", 移除 throttle 导入)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Observation 4: 文件已成功修改。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Thought 5: helpers.ts 处理完毕。继续检查下一个文件...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>...（循环继续）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"react-与函数调用-function-calling-的结合\">ReAct 与函数调用（Function Calling）的结合</h3><p>在现代 AI 编程工具中，ReAct 模式通过 LLM 的函数调用机制来实现：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as User&#10;    participant A as Agent (ReAct Loop)&#10;    participant LLM as LLM&#10;    participant T as Tool Set&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;A: &quot;Fix type error in login function&quot;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;LLM: System Prompt + User Instruction + Available tool list&#10;&#10;    Note over LLM: Thought: Need to view login function first&#10;    LLM--&gt;&gt;A: function_call: search_code(&quot;login function&quot;)&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;T: Execute search_code&#10;    T--&gt;&gt;A: Return search results&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;LLM: Context + Observation(Search Results)&#10;    Note over LLM: Thought: Found it, type error on line 42&#10;    LLM--&gt;&gt;A: function_call: read_file(&quot;src/auth.ts&quot;, line 35-50)&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;T: Execute read_file&#10;    T--&gt;&gt;A: Return file content&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;LLM: Context + Observation(File Content)&#10;    Note over LLM: Thought: Parameter type should be string, not number&#10;    LLM--&gt;&gt;A: function_call: edit_file(&quot;src/auth.ts&quot;, ...)&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;T: Execute edit_file&#10;    T--&gt;&gt;A: File modified&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;LLM: Context + Observation(Modification successful)&#10;    Note over LLM: Thought: Fix done, summarize results&#10;    LLM--&gt;&gt;A: Final answer&#10;&#10;    A--&gt;&gt;U: Return fix results\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as User\n    participant A as Agent (ReAct Loop)\n    participant LLM as LLM\n    participant T as Tool Set\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;A: \"Fix type error in login function\"\n    A-&gt;&gt;LLM: System Prompt + User Instruction + Available tool list\n\n    Note over LLM: Thought: Need to view login function first\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;A: function_call: search_code(\"login function\")\n    A-&gt;&gt;T: Execute search_code\n    T--&gt;&gt;A: Return search results\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;LLM: Context + Observation(Search Results)\n    Note over LLM: Thought: Found it, type error on line 42\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;A: function_call: read_file(\"src/auth.ts\", line 35-50)\n    A-&gt;&gt;T: Execute read_file\n    T--&gt;&gt;A: Return file content\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;LLM: Context + Observation(File Content)\n    Note over LLM: Thought: Parameter type should be string, not number\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;A: function_call: edit_file(\"src/auth.ts\", ...)\n    A-&gt;&gt;T: Execute edit_file\n    T--&gt;&gt;A: File modified\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;LLM: Context + Observation(Modification successful)\n    Note over LLM: Thought: Fix done, summarize results\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;A: Final answer\n\n    A--&gt;&gt;U: Return fix results</pre><h3 id=\"实现伪代码\">实现伪代码</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ReActStep {&#10;  thought: string;&#10;  action: ToolCall | null;&#10;  observation: string | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function reactLoop(task: string, tools: ToolDefinition[], maxSteps: number = 20): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  const history: ReActStep[] = [];&#10;  let currentContext = buildInitialContext(task, tools);&#10;&#10;  for (let step = 0; step &lt; maxSteps; step++) {&#10;    const llmResponse = await callLLM(currentContext);&#10;&#10;    if (llmResponse.type === &#39;final_answer&#39;) {&#10;      return llmResponse.content;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (llmResponse.type === &#39;function_call&#39;) {&#10;      const tool = tools.find((t) =&gt; t.name === llmResponse.functionName);&#10;      const observation = await tool.execute(llmResponse.arguments);&#10;&#10;      history.push({&#10;        thought: llmResponse.reasoning,&#10;        action: llmResponse.functionCall,&#10;        observation: observation.output,&#10;      });&#10;&#10;      currentContext = updateContext(currentContext, history);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return &#39;达到最大步数限制，返回当前最佳结果&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReActStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  thought</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolCall</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  observation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reactLoop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolDefinition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxSteps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReActStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentContext </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildInitialContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(task, tools);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxSteps; step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> llmResponse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> callLLM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(currentContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (llmResponse.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'final_answer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llmResponse.content;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (llmResponse.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'function_call'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tools.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llmResponse.functionName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tool.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(llmResponse.arguments);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      history.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        thought: llmResponse.reasoning,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        action: llmResponse.functionCall,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        observation: observation.output,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      currentContext </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(currentContext, history);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '达到最大步数限制，返回当前最佳结果'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心组件\">核心组件</h2><h3 id=\"react-的内部机制\">ReAct 的内部机制</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    INPUT[&quot;Input: Task + Context&quot;]&#10;    INPUT --&gt; PROMPT[&quot;Build Prompt&quot;]&#10;&#10;    PROMPT --&gt; LLM_CALL[&quot;LLM Reasoning&quot;]&#10;&#10;    LLM_CALL --&gt;|&quot;Generate Thought&quot;| THOUGHT[&quot;Thought Content&quot;]&#10;    THOUGHT --&gt; DECISION{&quot;Decision&quot;}&#10;&#10;    DECISION --&gt;|&quot;Need more info&quot;| ACTION[&quot;Generate Action&quot;]&#10;    DECISION --&gt;|&quot;Have enough info&quot;| ANSWER[&quot;Generate Final Answer&quot;]&#10;&#10;    ACTION --&gt; EXEC[&quot;Execute Tool Call&quot;]&#10;    EXEC --&gt; OBS[&quot;Get Observation&quot;]&#10;    OBS --&gt; APPEND[&quot;Append to Context&quot;]&#10;    APPEND --&gt; LLM_CALL\">flowchart TD\n    INPUT[\"Input: Task + Context\"]\n    INPUT --&gt; PROMPT[\"Build Prompt\"]\n\n    PROMPT --&gt; LLM_CALL[\"LLM Reasoning\"]\n\n    LLM_CALL --&gt;|\"Generate Thought\"| THOUGHT[\"Thought Content\"]\n    THOUGHT --&gt; DECISION{\"Decision\"}\n\n    DECISION --&gt;|\"Need more info\"| ACTION[\"Generate Action\"]\n    DECISION --&gt;|\"Have enough info\"| ANSWER[\"Generate Final Answer\"]\n\n    ACTION --&gt; EXEC[\"Execute Tool Call\"]\n    EXEC --&gt; OBS[\"Get Observation\"]\n    OBS --&gt; APPEND[\"Append to Context\"]\n    APPEND --&gt; LLM_CALL</pre><h3 id=\"thought-的关键作用\">Thought 的关键作用</h3><p>Thought 不仅仅是&quot;额外的文字&quot;，它在 ReAct 循环中承担多重职责：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态评估</td>\n<td>判断当前已知信息和缺失信息</td>\n<td>&quot;我已经找到了函数定义，但还不知道调用方&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略选择</td>\n<td>决定下一步应该使用哪个工具</td>\n<td>&quot;应该用搜索而不是逐文件查看&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误分析</td>\n<td>工具调用失败时分析原因</td>\n<td>&quot;文件不存在，可能路径有误，换个搜索方式&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果验证</td>\n<td>判断是否需要额外验证步骤</td>\n<td>&quot;代码已修改，但应该运行测试来验证&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进度跟踪</td>\n<td>记录已完成和待完成的子任务</td>\n<td>&quot;3 个文件中已修复 2 个，还剩 1 个&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"上下文管理策略\">上下文管理策略</h3><p>随着 ReAct 循环的进行，上下文会不断增长，需要策略来管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ContextManager {&#10;  addStep(step: ReActStep): void;&#10;  getContext(maxTokens: number): string;&#10;  summarizeOldSteps(): void;&#10;  getStepCount(): number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function buildContext(history: ReActStep[], maxTokens: number): string {&#10;  if (estimateTokens(history) &lt;= maxTokens) {&#10;    return formatAllSteps(history);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const recentSteps = history.slice(-5);&#10;  const oldSteps = history.slice(0, -5);&#10;  const summary = summarize(oldSteps);&#10;&#10;  return `${summary}\\n\\n--- 最近步骤 ---\\n\\n${formatAllSteps(recentSteps)}`;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContextManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  addStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReActStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxTokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  summarizeOldSteps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getStepCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">history</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReActStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxTokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">estimateTokens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(history) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxTokens) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatAllSteps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(history);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> recentSteps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> history.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> oldSteps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> history.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> summary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> summarize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(oldSteps);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">summary</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">--- 最近步骤 ---</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatAllSteps</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">recentSteps</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"优缺点分析\">优缺点分析</h2><h3 id=\"react-vs-直接提示-vs-纯-cot\">ReAct vs 直接提示 vs 纯 CoT</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>直接提示</th>\n<th>纯 CoT</th>\n<th>ReAct</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推理透明度</td>\n<td>❌ 不透明</td>\n<td>✅ 可见推理链</td>\n<td>✅ 思考过程 + 行动轨迹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部信息获取</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>✅ 通过工具调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幻觉控制</td>\n<td>❌ 容易幻觉</td>\n<td>⚠️ 推理可能偏离</td>\n<td>✅ 用事实校正推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误恢复</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>✅ 观察错误后可调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 消耗</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应延迟</td>\n<td>低（单次调用）</td>\n<td>中（较长输出）</td>\n<td>高（多次循环）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>简单问答</td>\n<td>数学/逻辑推理</td>\n<td>需要工具的复杂任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"优势详解\">优势详解</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>透明可审计</strong>：每一步的 Thought 让人类可以理解 Agent 在做什么以及为什么</li>\n<li><strong>动态错误恢复</strong>：如果某个工具调用失败或返回了意料之外的结果，下一个 Thought 可以分析原因并调整策略</li>\n<li><strong>事实锚定</strong>：Observation 提供了来自真实世界的反馈，有效减少幻觉</li>\n<li><strong>灵活适应</strong>：不需要预先定义完整计划，可以根据实际情况动态调整</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"局限性详解\">局限性详解</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>延迟累积</strong>：每一步都需要一次 LLM 调用 + 一次工具调用，多步循环导致显著延迟</li>\n<li><strong>Token 成本</strong>：上下文随循环不断增长，后期每次 LLM 调用的 Token 消耗越来越大</li>\n<li><strong>循环风险</strong>：模型可能陷入无效循环，反复执行相似的操作而无实质进展</li>\n<li><strong>过度思考</strong>：某些简单任务不需要 ReAct 循环，直接执行反而更高效</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Cost-Benefit Balance&#10;        direction LR&#10;        SIMPLE[&quot;Simple Tasks&lt;br/&gt;Direct prompting better&quot;] --&gt; MEDIUM[&quot;Medium Tasks&lt;br/&gt;ReAct optimal range&quot;] --&gt; COMPLEX[&quot;Complex Tasks&lt;br/&gt;Need planning + ReAct&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Cost-Benefit Balance\n        direction LR\n        SIMPLE[\"Simple Tasks&lt;br/&gt;Direct prompting better\"] --&gt; MEDIUM[\"Medium Tasks&lt;br/&gt;ReAct optimal range\"] --&gt; COMPLEX[\"Complex Tasks&lt;br/&gt;Need planning + ReAct\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"变体与演进\">变体与演进</h2><h3 id=\"react-的变体\">ReAct 的变体</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>改进点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ReAct + Reflection</td>\n<td>在循环中加入反思步骤</td>\n<td>减少重复错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ReWOO</td>\n<td>先规划所有步骤再批量执行</td>\n<td>减少 LLM 调用次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LATS</td>\n<td>用树搜索替代线性循环</td>\n<td>探索多条推理路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reflexion</td>\n<td>在任务失败后做长期反思</td>\n<td>跨任务学习能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"在-ai-编程工具中的实现\">在 AI 编程工具中的实现</h3><p>几乎所有现代 AI 编程 Agent 的核心循环都是 ReAct 模式的变体：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Trae Agent 的核心循环（概念描述）&#10;loop:&#10;  step_1: 接收上下文（系统提示 + 对话历史 + 工具结果）&#10;  step_2: LLM 推理（隐含 Thought + 输出 Action 或 Answer）&#10;  step_3: 如果输出包含 tool_call → 执行工具 → 将结果作为 Observation 追加到上下文&#10;  step_4: 如果输出是文本回答 → 循环结束&#10;  step_5: 回到 step_1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Trae Agent 的核心循环（概念描述）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">loop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">接收上下文（系统提示 + 对话历史 + 工具结果）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LLM 推理（隐含 Thought + 输出 Action 或 Answer）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">如果输出包含 tool_call → 执行工具 → 将结果作为 Observation 追加到上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">如果输出是文本回答 → 循环结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">回到 step_1</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Claude Code 的核心循环（概念描述）&#10;loop:&#10;  step_1: 构建 messages 数组（system + user + assistant + tool_result...）&#10;  step_2: 调用 API，获取 assistant 响应&#10;  step_3: 解析响应中的 tool_use blocks&#10;  step_4: 并行执行所有 tool_use → 生成 tool_result&#10;  step_5: 将 assistant message 和 tool_result 追加到 messages&#10;  step_6: 如果有 tool_use → 继续循环；否则 → 结束\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Claude Code 的核心循环（概念描述）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">loop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">构建 messages 数组（system + user + assistant + tool_result...）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">调用 API，获取 assistant 响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">解析响应中的 tool_use blocks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">并行执行所有 tool_use → 生成 tool_result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">将 assistant message 和 tool_result 追加到 messages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  step_6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">如果有 tool_use → 继续循环；否则 → 结束</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在实际实现中，Thought 通常不会作为单独的文本段落出现，而是隐含在 LLM 生成 function_call 之前的推理中。一些工具（如 Claude）使用 <code>&lt;thinking&gt;</code> 标签或 extended thinking 功能让 Thought 显式可见。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>ReAct 模式通过交替执行 Thought（思考）、Action（行动）和 Observation（观察）三个步骤，将 LLM 的推理能力与工具调用能力有机结合。相比直接提示和纯思维链，ReAct 能够获取外部信息、动态纠错、并保持推理过程的透明性。虽然它带来了延迟和 Token 成本的增加，但对于需要多步推理和工具交互的复杂编程任务来说，ReAct 几乎是当前所有 AI 编程 Agent 的核心架构模式。理解 ReAct 的工作机制，是理解 Trae、Claude Code 等工具如何运作的关键。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ReAct 模式","id":"react-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模式定义","id":"模式定义"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":3,"text":"ReAct 逐步执行示例","id":"react-逐步执行示例"},{"level":3,"text":"ReAct 与函数调用（Function Calling）的结合","id":"react-与函数调用-function-calling-的结合"},{"level":3,"text":"实现伪代码","id":"实现伪代码"},{"level":2,"text":"核心组件","id":"核心组件"},{"level":3,"text":"ReAct 的内部机制","id":"react-的内部机制"},{"level":3,"text":"Thought 的关键作用","id":"thought-的关键作用"},{"level":3,"text":"上下文管理策略","id":"上下文管理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"优缺点分析","id":"优缺点分析"},{"level":3,"text":"ReAct vs 直接提示 vs 纯 CoT","id":"react-vs-直接提示-vs-纯-cot"},{"level":3,"text":"优势详解","id":"优势详解"},{"level":3,"text":"局限性详解","id":"局限性详解"},{"level":2,"text":"变体与演进","id":"变体与演进"},{"level":3,"text":"ReAct 的变体","id":"react-的变体"},{"level":3,"text":"在 AI 编程工具中的实现","id":"在-ai-编程工具中的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SubAgent 与多智能体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns/subagent-and-multi-agent"},"next":{"title":"规划与反思","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns/planning-and-reflection"}}